OL,3,GNEWSA'Litter less' plea to reduce rat  
OL,4,Areports                                
OL,6,FA councillor responsible for dealing   
OL,7,Fwith 4,740 rodent reports made this    
OL,8,Fyear has urged people to dispose of    
OL,9,Flitter and not dump food waste.        
OL,11,FBill Blackett, Sunderland City         
OL,12,FCouncil's cabinet member for the       
OL,13,Fenvironment, revealed the figure -     
OL,14,Fwhich was a reduction on last year's   
OL,15,F5,182 rat sightings - in response to   
OL,16,Fquestions from an opposition councillor
OL,17,Fwho had concerns about rodents near    
OL,18,FBarnes Park.                           
OL,20,FLabour's Caroline Cromer asked what    
OL,21,Faction was being taken to tackle       
OL,22,Fhotspots.                              
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
