OL,3,GNEWSA'Litter less' plea to reduce rat  
OL,4,Areports                                
OL,6,FBlackett said the Reform UK-led        
OL,7,Fcouncil's pest controllers responded to
OL,8,Freports, but advised: "If people       
OL,9,Fdispose of litter appropriately, rats  
OL,10,Fmight move elsewhere for a meal."      
